msgid ""
"HTTP scenarios did fire and their paths, methods and status codes came "
"through, so only the {user_agent} key is missing. Traefik drops request "
"headers from its access log unless you keep them, so CrowdSec never sees "
"one. Add {user_agent_keep} under {accesslog_fields_headers} in the static "
"config, then restart Traefik."
msgstr ""
"HTTP-scenarier blev udløst, og deres stier, metoder og statuskoder kom "
"igennem, så kun {user_agent}-nøglen mangler. Traefik fjerner request-headers "
"fra sin adgangslog, medmindre du beholder dem, så CrowdSec ser aldrig en. "
"Tilføj {user_agent_keep} under {accesslog_fields_headers} i den statiske "
"konfiguration, og genstart derefter Traefik."

