#, python-format
msgid ""
"Optional - for a LAPI behind mutual TLS. Path to a PEM file mounted into "
"this container. The certificate authenticates %(decisions)s instead of the "
"API key and %(alerts)s instead of the machine login - or alongside them."
msgstr ""
"Valgfri - til en LAPI bag mutual TLS. Sti til en PEM-fil monteret i denne "
"container. Certifikatet godkender %(decisions)s i stedet for API-nøglen og "
"%(alerts)s i stedet for maskinloginet - eller sammen med dem."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"Optional - required to read %(alerts)s and to unban (delete decisions); "
"bouncer keys cannot access those endpoints. Create one with "
"%(cscli_machines_add)s."
msgstr ""
"Valgfri - kræves for at læse %(alerts)s og for at ophæve blokeringer (slette "
"decisions); bouncer-nøgler har ikke adgang til de endpoints. Opret en med "
"%(cscli_machines_add)s."

msgid "Optional credentials for endpoints that require authentication."
msgstr ""
"Valgfrie legitimationsoplysninger til endpoints, der kræver godkendelse."

