msgid ""
"The CrowdSec fields on this server in Settings only build the compose "
"snippet below - they are never pushed to a running agent."
msgstr ""
"CrowdSec-felterne for denne server i Indstillinger bygger kun compose-"
"uddraget nedenfor - de sendes aldrig til en kørende agent."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Host can back this agent up to its own repository instead, on a separate "
"branch, using the Host's credentials. Nothing is configured on the agent and "
"no token is stored on it. Select this server in the switcher, then turn on "
"%(use_host_repository)s under %(backups_git)s."
msgstr ""
"Hosten kan i stedet tage backup af denne agent til sit eget repository, på "
"en separat branch, med Hostens legitimationsoplysninger. Intet konfigureres "
"på agenten, og intet token gemmes på den. Vælg denne server i "
"serverskifteren, og slå derefter %(use_host_repository)s til under "
"%(backups_git)s."

#. Used in the browser
msgid "The LAPI did not answer"
msgstr "LAPI'et svarede ikke"

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The LAPI refused {v1_alerts}{value}. A bouncer API key reads decisions only, "
"and CrowdSec refuses the machine token on the decisions endpoint in return, "
"so a full picture needs both credentials. The scenario, path, network and "
"tooling cards above are not empty, they are not readable.{value2}"
msgstr ""
"LAPI'et afviste {v1_alerts}{value}. En bouncer-API-nøgle læser kun "
"decisions, og CrowdSec afviser til gengæld maskintokenet på decisions-"
"endpointet, så et fuldt billede kræver begge legitimationsoplysninger. "
"Kortene for scenarier, stier, netværk og værktøjer ovenfor er ikke tomme, de "
"kan ikke læses.{value2}"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The TLS options %(name)s are not defined anywhere. Create them first, or "
"correct the name."
msgstr ""
"TLS-indstillingerne %(name)s er ikke defineret nogen steder. Opret dem "
"først, eller ret navnet."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The Traefik entry point to attach the router to, as named in your static "
"config - commonly %(websecure)s or %(https)s."
msgstr ""
"Det Traefik-entrypoint, routeren skal knyttes til, som navngivet i din "
"statiske konfiguration - typisk %(websecure)s eller %(https)s."

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The agent reads CrowdSec from its %(own_container_environment)s, not from "
"Traefik Manager. Set %(crowdsec_lapi_url)s on the agent container and "
"recreate it."
msgstr ""
"Agenten læser CrowdSec fra sit %(own_container_environment)s, ikke fra "
"Traefik Manager. Sæt %(crowdsec_lapi_url)s på agent-containeren, og genskab "
"den."

msgid ""
"The agent reads CrowdSec from its own container environment, so changing "
"anything here has no effect until you copy the compose below and recreate "
"the agent container. With mTLS, the cert paths must be mounted inside the "
"agent container too."
msgstr ""
"Agenten læser CrowdSec fra sit eget container-miljø, så ændringer her har "
"ingen effekt, før du kopierer compose nedenfor og genskaber agent-"
"containeren. Med mTLS skal certifikatstierne også være mountet i agent-"
"containeren."

msgid "The agent reads these from its own environment."
msgstr "Agenten læser disse fra sit eget miljø."

msgid "The agent refused the API key"
msgstr "Agenten afviste API-nøglen"

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The alert read succeeded and came back empty, which is not the same as being "
"unable to read it. {atkOwnNote}"
msgstr ""
"Læsningen af alerts lykkedes og kom tom tilbage, hvilket ikke er det samme "
"som ikke at kunne læse dem. {atkOwnNote}"

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The alert-level {meta} array carries {target_uri}, {method}, {status} and "
"{user_agent}, already deduplicated by the scenario. It is the only place "
"this tab can learn what an attacker was going after. {ATK_MACHINE_NOTE}"
msgstr ""
"{meta}-arrayet på alert-niveau indeholder {target_uri}, {method}, {status} "
"og {user_agent}, allerede deduplikeret af scenariet. Det er det eneste sted, "
"denne fane kan se, hvad en angriber gik efter. {ATK_MACHINE_NOTE}"

#. Used in the browser
msgid "The alerts endpoint refused the read."
msgstr "Alerts-endpointet afviste læsningen."

msgid ""
"The bouncer key reads active decisions, the machine login reads alerts. They "
"are complementary, not tiered. A client certificate covers both."
msgstr ""
"Bouncer-nøglen læser aktive decisions, maskinlogin læser alerts. De "
"supplerer hinanden og er ikke niveaudelte. Et klientcertifikat dækker begge."

msgid "The branch to commit to, and the account the token belongs to."
msgstr "Den branch, der skal committes til, og den konto, tokenet tilhører."

msgid ""
"The classic \"behind Cloudflare\" case. Hardcoded and refreshed on release - "
"no runtime fetch."
msgstr ""
"Det klassiske \"bag Cloudflare\"-tilfælde. Hardcodet og opdateret ved hver "
"udgivelse - ingen hentning under kørsel."

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The client IP the app trusts is {strong}. If clients should reach you from "
"the public internet, a proxy in front is rewriting it - check that your "
"trusted hops and the upstream {trustedips} are set correctly, or real client "
"IPs will be lost to logs, CrowdSec and ipAllowList."
msgstr ""
"Den klient-IP, appen stoler på, er {strong}. Hvis klienter skal nå dig fra "
"det offentlige internet, omskriver en proxy foran den - tjek, at dine "
"betroede hop og upstream {trustedips} er sat korrekt, ellers går rigtige "
"klient-IP'er tabt for logs, CrowdSec og ipAllowList."

msgid "The commit holds no config files for this agent"
msgstr "Committet indeholder ingen konfigurationsfiler for denne agent"

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"The common log writes whole milliseconds, so sub-millisecond timing is not "
"knowable."
msgstr ""
"Common-loggen skriver hele millisekunder, så timing under et millisekund kan "
"ikke kendes."

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"The crowdsecurity/geoip-enrich parser on the reporting machine fills "
"source.cn, source.as_name and the coordinates. The LAPI never computes them, "
"it stores what the agent sent"
msgstr ""
"Parseren crowdsecurity/geoip-enrich på den rapporterende maskine udfylder "
"source.cn, source.as_name og koordinaterne. LAPI'et beregner dem aldrig, det "
"gemmer, hvad agenten sendte"

