msgid "Traefik Manager Version badge, highlights when an update is available."
msgstr ""
"Versionsmærke for Traefik Manager, fremhæves, når en opdatering er "
"tilgængelig."

msgid ""
"Traefik Manager cannot read its configuration file, so it cannot tell "
"whether this is a new install. Setup is disabled until the file is fixed or "
"restored from a backup. See the container log for the path and the reason."
msgstr ""
"Traefik Manager kan ikke læse sin konfigurationsfil, så den kan ikke afgøre, "
"om dette er en ny installation. Opsætningen er deaktiveret, indtil filen er "
"rettet eller gendannet fra en backup. Se containerloggen for stien og "
"årsagen."

msgid "Traefik Manager documentation."
msgstr "Dokumentation til Traefik Manager."

#. Used in the browser
msgid "Traefik Manager installed as app!"
msgstr "Traefik Manager installeret som app."

msgid ""
"Traefik Manager manages one Traefik instance. To manage more, run a "
"lightweight agent next to each and register it here, then switch between "
"them from the server switcher. Adding an agent generates the compose snippet "
"and mints its API key."
msgstr ""
"Traefik Manager administrerer én Traefik-instans. For at administrere flere "
"skal du køre en letvægtsagent ved siden af hver og registrere den her, og så "
"skifte mellem dem i serverskifteren. Når du tilføjer en agent, genereres "
"compose-uddraget og dens API-nøgle."

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"Traefik Manager manages this service. Routes using it can edit their "
"backends here."
msgstr ""
"Traefik Manager administrerer denne service. Ruter, der bruger den, kan "
"redigere dens backends her."

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Traefik Manager now manages {name}"
msgstr "Traefik Manager administrerer nu {name}"

msgid ""
"Traefik Manager reads everything through the Traefik API. This is the one "
"step it cannot work without."
msgstr ""
"Traefik Manager læser alt via Traefik-API'et. Dette er det ene trin, den "
"ikke kan fungere uden."

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"Traefik Manager reads your routes, services and middlewares from the Traefik "
"API. With it disabled those tabs will be empty until you turn it back on and "
"restart Traefik."
msgstr ""
"Traefik Manager læser dine ruter, services og middlewares fra Traefik-"
"API'et. Når det er deaktiveret, er de faner tomme, indtil du slår det til "
"igen og genstarter Traefik."

